<title>USA: Competitive muni bond sales total $552 mln Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Competitive muni bond sales total $552 mln Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive municipal bond sales are expected to total $552 million in 22 offerings on Tuesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a combined $190 million Ohio bond deal set for 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
